{"parse": {"title": "FT-20", "pageid": 55374, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/FT-19\" title=\"FT-19\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">FT-20</span><a href=\"/wiki/FT-21\" title=\"FT-21\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">FT</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">20</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.BF.A1.E9.B8.BD\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"信鸽\">信鸽</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 信鸽</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Letter Home</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>湿<span class=\"color-value\"></span>漉<span class=\"color-value\"></span>漉<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>泥<span class=\"color-value\"></span>壤<span class=\"color-value\"></span>中<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>雨<span class=\"color-value\"></span>已<span class=\"color-value\"></span>浸<span class=\"color-value\"></span>透<span class=\"color-value\"></span>了<span class=\"color-value\"></span>毛<span class=\"color-value\"></span>羽<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2010120</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>我并不想提笔写这封信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>但我曾经保证过，如果有朝一日，当我们能平起平坐，我会说服你接受我所选择的道路。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_jiufangjian\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_jiufangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/30/Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/30/Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/30/Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>咳、咳……真够呛人的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>这里可得好好打扫一番。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>地面的灰尘在阳光下，熠熠生辉。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>我以为，当我站在与你同样高的地方，我便会拥有与你正面对峙的勇气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>当我的脚掌能踏到你未曾涉足的土地，当我的双眼看见了你所看不见的前方，我以为我能让你认识到你的愚钝与自私，你也许会以我为傲……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>但此刻，当我真正面对一个有着生命威胁的任务时，我觉察到我并非如我所说的那样勇敢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>我的笔在打颤，我知道我想要逃走，我不想面对危险，亦不想失去手中的拥有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>我不想死得默默无闻，更不想死在美好的结局到来的前一秒。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_jiufangjian\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_jiufangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/30/Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/30/Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/30/Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-309412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-309412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-309412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>噢？这个破洞待在这儿多久了……老伙计，那时候可真抱歉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-309411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-309411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-309411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我真不该拿靴子踹你。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>于是我想起，我跟你说过：“人是愿意死的。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>我想起你听到这句话时，第一次露出了害怕的表情，啊……那时候的我感到自豪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>“我总算是吓到这个大个子了。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>如今，我却想咒骂当时的自己，因为这并不光荣，打败你并不光荣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>因为，我明明知道——这仅仅是因为，我是这个世界上唯一能伤害你的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“咚咚咚……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>我的职位已足够令我能与你平起平坐，我们一样高了，哥哥。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>可是……我突然后悔了，外派调查任务的同行职员，现在正在敲响我的门扉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>他大声喊叫着：“保利娜！保利娜！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>我多想，我多想现在在外面敲门的人是你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>我希望你敲开门，拦住我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>可那仅仅是，一瞬间……一瞬间的念头，我明白我的恐惧，正如此时我也明白了你当时第一次害怕的面孔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>我明白，此时此刻，还有无数的平民在受到折磨与煎熬，敌人又割开了基金会同袍的喉咙，一个家庭溃散，一栋楼宇倒塌，有孩子无家可归，同样有人痛彻心扉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>而我并不勇敢。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_jiufangjian\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_jiufangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/30/Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/30/Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/30/Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>呼……终于修好了，老伙计，现在你的气色看起来好多了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>门上久远的破洞，已被木板弥合。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯普特尼克：</div><div>J先生……您真的要转让这家餐馆的管理权吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>别担心，女士，会有新的阔绰的家伙来接手的。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>但我明白，在这场时代的悲剧之中，总要有人伸出手，否则我们将分崩离析，否则恸哭会传遍世界上的每一个角落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>世界上不存在只有一滴水的海，也不存在只流一滴血的战争，也从未有过——仅有一片瓦片的屋顶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>人类、神秘学家……我们各执己见，各司其职……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>如果没有凝聚，我们都将沦为一片乌有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>我是一场时代洪流中，最微不足道的一块挡石，随时会被冲走，随时会被遗忘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>我是一个怯弱、胆小的人类。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>但我也是圣洛夫基金会的一员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>如今，时过境迁，我意识到，我才刚刚真正获得了当初说出那句话的勇气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>“人是愿意忍受痛苦，人也是愿意死的。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>正好……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>砖石会筑成围墙，雨迟早会有停下的一天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未署名者：</div><div>逝去的人儿不再，但新的时代终将来临……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>门外正有人招手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-625801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-625801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-625801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>该走了，J。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他将照片摘下，接着把信纸对折，抚平——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一齐收入了胸膛的口袋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>像她当初那样，走出了门扉。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "FT-20"}}